; F6 (R12S): the storage texel image load is numbered %32 while the
; uint type declaration carries the literal width 32. The pre-fix
; consumer scan compares raw words and mistakes the width literal for
; a consumer of the image; the operand-aware scan walks only id-typed
; operands and the conversion proceeds. Modeled on vkd3d-proton's
; cs_clear_uav_buffer_uint meta clear (writeonly uimageBuffer, format
; injected later by R14 from the bound view, hence Unknown here with
; the WriteWithoutFormat capability the real module carries).
; Assemble: spirv-as --preserve-numeric-ids --target-env vulkan1.1
OpCapability Shader
OpCapability ImageBuffer
OpCapability StorageImageWriteWithoutFormat
%1 = OpExtInstImport "GLSL.std.450"
OpMemoryModel Logical GLSL450
OpEntryPoint GLCompute %13 "main"
OpExecutionMode %13 LocalSize 1 1 1
OpDecorate %6 DescriptorSet 0
OpDecorate %6 Binding 0
%2 = OpTypeVoid
%3 = OpTypeInt 32 0
%4 = OpTypeImage %3 Buffer 0 0 0 2 Unknown
%5 = OpTypePointer UniformConstant %4
%6 = OpVariable %5 UniformConstant
%7 = OpTypeFunction %2
%8 = OpConstant %3 7
%9 = OpTypeVector %3 4
%10 = OpConstant %3 255
%11 = OpConstantComposite %9 %10 %10 %10 %10
%13 = OpFunction %2 None %7
%14 = OpLabel
%32 = OpLoad %4 %6
OpImageWrite %32 %8 %11
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
